Accept: application/json

###

### 37. 프로젝트 캐싱 테스트 - 첫 번째
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search/projects?keyword=웹개발&sortBy=deadline&page=0&size=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 38. 프로젝트 캐싱 테스트 - 두 번째 (캐시됨)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/search/projects?keyword=웹개발&sortBy=deadline&page=0&size=5
Accept: application/json

